[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692440313","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103443#issuecomment-2692440313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103443","id":2692440313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ge2D5","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-01T22:01:56Z","updated_at":"2025-03-01T22:01:56Z","body":"This should be a quick fix. The call to finalize should be wrapped in RenderingServer.call_on_render_thread()","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692440313/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695330015","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103443#issuecomment-2695330015","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103443","id":2695330015,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gp3jf","user":{"login":"olukowski","id":63189113,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMTg5MTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63189113?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski","html_url":"https://github.com/olukowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T19:20:16Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T19:20:16Z","body":"I will go ahead and tackle this! This is the first issue I'm solving, so I hope I do it correctly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695330015/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695440422","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103443#issuecomment-2695440422","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103443","id":2695440422,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gqSgm","user":{"login":"olukowski","id":63189113,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMTg5MTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63189113?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski","html_url":"https://github.com/olukowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T20:14:43Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T20:14:43Z","body":"Ran into a bit of an issue. It seems that deferring the `finalize` call to the render thread causes it to not get called anymore. I only found out about this because of this warning about a leak:\n\n```\nWARNING: ObjectDB instances leaked at exit (run with --verbose for details).\n     at: cleanup (core/object/object.cpp:2378)\nLeaked instance: Object:96217338099\n```\n\nAfter some classic print-debugging, it seems that the `finalize` method does not get called anymore. Maybe my code is wrong? Here is the line I placed in the `RenderingDevice::~RenderingDevice` (which is the only place where finalize was called as far as I can tell):\n```cpp\nRenderingServer::get_singleton()->call_on_render_thread(Callable(this, \"finalize\"));\n```\n\nI would really appreciate any and all guidance here!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695440422/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695472623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103443#issuecomment-2695472623","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103443","id":2695472623,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gqaXv","user":{"login":"olukowski","id":63189113,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMTg5MTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63189113?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski","html_url":"https://github.com/olukowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olukowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T20:32:23Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T20:32:23Z","body":"I figured this out I think! Had to bind the finalize method in `_bind_methods` like this:\n\n```cpp\nClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"finalize\"), &RenderingDevice::finalize);\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695472623/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695476332","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103443#issuecomment-2695476332","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103443","id":2695476332,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gqbRs","user":{"login":"Zylann","id":1311555,